{"title":"1998 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a08e8821b2cc7c9eeaa4d4ebc9364250365edc19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" /> intersects the parabola <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/e/0befcc6469641b2b3e386b6e863e0b0e9e528279.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x^{2} - 3x - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"20\" /> at the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2c&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Determine the coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equations will be equal when they intersect, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/faea6abe93d69a46716ee37d8d70c5b0d02ae8d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 1 = x^{2} - 3x - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"159\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/5/34553c18ea4050b1a192a58ff703aea30d620a34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} - 4x - 5 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/2/a526e44e36254c196af103613bc724f312b6a209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> add up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/d/72d85c6959aaabfff6e0104544ff25c1445f3f1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" /> and multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/2/a526e44e36254c196af103613bc724f312b6a209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/8/fb82b0dbc1c09789fd65ed74d12a862d980bdf3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} - 5x + x - 5 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"159\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/b/88babe3f728cf4142a4b6eb15054f23f0a850f74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x - 5) + 1(x - 5) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/6/3a6239bb0b477aa3531c51bbeaa49cfa42beef78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + 1)(x - 5) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We then see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/6/88663eb3d0085a490e77c997290fe2fd19d052de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/0/b50034221c2c658c2eac5bd3243d26665a878553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 5 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d4c38a419ae56f13a202216dd45a1978bc91a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d4c38a419ae56f13a202216dd45a1978bc91a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/9/909fff5a37866f38f9209347f28daeb552c71f42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -1 + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"17\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/2/762d5073401fd1410b523f4d070c538da317a578.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 5 + 1 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"17\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is then at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/f/29faaa2778e691f3be2b20cef8d1479f1a1ccc45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(-1, 0)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"68\" height=\"32\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/d/14d213c0038fde99a9cbe2057582346684f07ca5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(5, 6)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"54\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017191513\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 111/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 491/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4836/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.184      1 -total\n 45.08%    5.944      1 1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n 39.54%    5.213      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36598:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017191513 and revision id 282432. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}